Error [E0985]: `var` is no longer a binding keyword in Jet
  --> tests/ui/foreign_while.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     var i = 0;
    |     ^^^
 Why: bindings are written with a sigil: `name :: value` (immutable) or `name := value` (mutable)
 Fix: write `name := value` instead of `var name = value`

Error [E0050]: `while` is not a keyword; write `loop` instead
  --> tests/ui/foreign_while.jet:3:5
    |
  3 |     while i < 5 {
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: `Jet` has a single loop keyword: `loop cond { }` for conditional loops
 Fix: replace `while` with `loop`
